@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Sans Serif"
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam activityBorderColor #444

title Trace Processing Pipeline

|Capture|
start
:Raw trace bytes arrive\nfrom debug probe;

|Accumulation|
:TraceManager accumulates\nbytes until a decodable\nunit is ready;

|Decode|
:TraceSession submits\nbytes to protocol decoder;
:Decoder produces a stream\nof TraceRecord values;

|Transform|
fork
    :ReconstructedInstruction\ntransform;
    note right
      Expands instruction
      ranges into individual
      instructions using
      precomputed data
    end note
fork again
    :FunctionBlock\ntransform;
    note right
      Groups instructions
      into function and
      line blocks
    end note
fork again
    :TraceGap\ntransform;
    note right
      Extracts discontinuity
      markers
    end note
end fork

|Emission|
:TraceManager emits\ndomain event via EventBus;

|Translation|
:Session translates to\nprotocol event and\nsends to frontend;
stop
@enduml
